      "updated": 1776014096443,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "what is expected from you as a product manager??\n\n    --- a relibale backend which is little resilient and can be scaled\n    --- should add a feedback loop if the client doesn't like the output\n    --- can add a prompt section also with the ad and landing page url\n        for little customiszation\n\n   ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "what is expected from you as a product manager??\n\n    --- a relibale backend which is little resilient and can be scaled\n    --- should add a feedback loop if the client doesn't like the output\n    --- can add a prompt section also with the ad and landing page url\n        for little customiszation\n\n   ",
