      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776008651408,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rate Limit Note\n\nThis is a fully working project. Current API\nusage is on free-tier keys, so requests can hit\nrate limits (429) under load.\nSystem behavior: requests are queued, delayed,\nand retried automatically; if limits persist, wait\nand retry.\n\nIf you want an even shorter one-liner for the\nflowchart:\n\nFree-tier API in use -> occasional 429 rate\nlimits; auto-retry is enabled.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Upg3tC4CD36VK6vo0Hc1f",
      "originalText": "Rate Limit Note\n\nThis is a fully working project. Current API usage is on free-tier keys, so requests can hit rate limits (429) under load.\nSystem behavior: requests are queued, delayed, and retried automatically; if limits persist, wait and retry.\n\nIf you want an even shorter one-liner for the flowchart:\n\nFree-tier API in use -> occasional 429 rate limits; auto-retry is enabled.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
